    "solid-js@1.9.x": "The development query inspector uses Solid 1.9 with fixed 1.6.x serializer ranges. Use the patched seroval and seroval-plugins 1.x APIs for GHSA-6q9x-xgwm-cfpg, GHSA-72px-vh6m-89wc and GHSA-fc89-m4rj-8472. Remove when Solid accepts those patched versions."
  },
